# 统一按文本处理，检出时用各平台默认换行（Windows 上是 CRLF，仓库里存 LF）
* text=auto

# 明确是文本的文件
*.py   text
*.js   text
*.css  text
*.html text
*.md   text
*.txt  text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.json text

# 二进制文件：不要做换行转换，也不要尝试 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.svg  text
*.db   binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
